msgid "### 5.2 Multi-node Deployment {: #multi-node-deployment }"
msgstr "### 5.2 Multi-node Deployment {: #multi-node-deployment }"

msgid "Before a multi-node deployment, verify:"
msgstr "Multi-node 部署要求先验证："

msgid ""
"1. physical links;\n"
"2. the NPU network on each node;\n"
"3. communication between nodes;\n"
"4. consistent containers and software stacks across all nodes."
msgstr ""
"1. 物理链路；\n"
"2. 单节点 NPU 网络；\n"
"3. 节点间通信；\n"
"4. 每个节点的容器和软件栈一致性。"

msgid "#### 5.2.1 Physical Layer Requirements"
msgstr "#### 5.2.1 物理层要求"

msgid ""
"- The physical hosts are on mutually reachable networks;\n"
"- optical modules and network links between NPUs are working;\n"
"- switch, NIC, and NPU network configurations match the deployment topology."
msgstr ""
"- 多台物理机位于可互通网络；\n"
"- NPU 间光模块/网络链路正常；\n"
"- 交换机、网卡和 NPU 网络配置符合部署拓扑。"

msgid "#### 5.2.2 Checks on Each Node"
msgstr "#### 5.2.2 每个节点检查"

msgid "Example for Atlas A2 / a typical node with eight NPU indices:"
msgstr "Atlas A2 / 典型 8-index 节点示例："

msgid "??? note \"Atlas A3\""
msgstr "??? note \"Atlas A3\""

msgid ""
"If the current topology exposes 16 NPU indices, replace `{0..7}` with "
"`{0..15}`."
msgstr "如果当前拓扑暴露 16 个 NPU index，将 `{0..7}` 替换为 `{0..15}`。"

msgid "#### 5.2.3 Obtain NPU IP Addresses"
msgstr "#### 5.2.3 获取 NPU IP"

msgid "For an Atlas A3 topology with 16 indices, use `{0..15}`."
msgstr "Atlas A3 16-index 拓扑使用 `{0..15}`。"

msgid "#### 5.2.4 Ping Across Nodes"
msgstr "#### 5.2.4 跨节点 Ping"

msgid "Run the following command on the source node:"
msgstr "在目标节点执行："

msgid "Verify every NPU link that will participate in communication."
msgstr "所有参与通信的 NPU 链路都应通过验证。"

msgid "#### 5.2.5 Additional Ascend 950DT Pre-checks"
msgstr "#### 5.2.5 Ascend 950DT 额外预检查"

msgid ""
"Before deploying the Ascend 950 series, confirm that the following files or "
"directories exist and match the actual UB topology:"
msgstr "Ascend 950 系列部署前，应确认下列文件或目录存在并与实际 UB 拓扑匹配："

msgid ""
"If the contents are missing or do not match the actual topology, generate "
"and validate them first according to the corresponding HiXLEP configuration "
"documentation."
msgstr "如果内容缺失或与实际拓扑不匹配，需要先按照对应 HiXLEP 配置文档完成生成和校验。"

msgid "#### 5.2.6 Software Environment on Each Node"
msgstr "#### 5.2.6 各节点软件环境"

msgid "All nodes must use the same:"
msgstr "所有节点应使用相同的："

msgid ""
"- vLLM Ascend release;\n"
"- vLLM version;\n"
"- CANN/TorchNPU versions;\n"
"- model weights;\n"
"- container image;\n"
"- runtime configuration."
msgstr ""
"- vLLM Ascend release；\n"
"- vLLM；\n"
"- CANN/TorchNPU；\n"
"- 模型权重；\n"
"- 容器镜像；\n"
"- runtime configuration。"

msgid ""
"Continue to follow the hardware- and model-specific deployment documentation"
" for container device mappings."
msgstr "容器启动的 device mapping 仍按具体硬件和模型部署文档执行。"

msgid ""
"Multi-node model serving commands are outside the scope of Installation. "
"After completing the environment checks, proceed to the corresponding "
"[Feature Tutorials](../tutorials/features/index.md) or model tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Multi-node 的模型服务命令不在 Installation 中展开；完成环境检查后，\n"
"进入对应的 [Feature Tutorials](../tutorials/features/index.md) 或模型教程。"
